{"ref":"BDB, נָשִׂיא²","hw":"נָשִׂיא²","html":"† II. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נָשִׂיא</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>rising mist, vapour (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">نَشْءٌ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">نَشِىٌٔ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—only pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְשִׂאִים</span> <em>vapours</em>, forming clouds, and portending rain, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.13\">Je 10:13</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.16\">51:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 135:7\" href=\"/Psalms.135.7\">ψ 135:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נְשִׂיאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.14\">Pr 25:14</a>.","next":"BDB, מַשָּׂא³","prev":"BDB, נָשִׂיא"}